        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aniini Gilawdiyooyda Lisiya gil, ak geang'oorneey barawajeanji ang'iing'i Sugoocheanda Mureeda Feliki. Seayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siisi ghoang'waay fuga Yahudi, ak gwaramagu gwanuus, iidu geawi roonyeeda nea geadeani shirikara ak ghaaweachi, ak geegu iita gideaba siisi gaba ng'eanyiida Rumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geagasayi danal giidiinyeandeaba siisi, ak ghaayaachi madeeda girgweageeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geajeeng'u gideaba geergweaksiina sheang'nyeeda ng'asheega deaweedeeda gheanyaawa, ak ea mwaadaahi ramaseanda sin siisi miisa nuusta ghana gawa ghealooniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geeyeanean iita gideaba geesin badiida gichea gwanuusta, hean geabay deadu headaang'u, gwarugu fuga argweaksa gidamideayeesa siisi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu shirikara aba gidida ghayi siinaaldaan, ak ghwaat Bawlo eawa ea ghoahiita heeda Antipatri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gabiikta shirikareedida heeda abiita, nea ghwanung'wa heeda shirikareeda beawa faraasajeega nea ghwaat Bawlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeweay, ama sihita ng'eanyiida Gaysariya ak ghoadaw sugoocheanda barawajeandida, hean geayiin Bawlo madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiit giisoomandeaba barawajeandida, hean ghoanyaashta gideaba gwaleabu ana daroar. Iidu ghwanal gideaba gwaleabu ng'eanyiida Gilikiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Gaydealeeysiit girgweageadaang'u iihidu fuga ahaaktaneey.” Ak gwayeesha, ayaada jeeda gheeh Herode ak goofurji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
